 "note": "The app was built from this commit. The engine, scoring and synthetic generator scripts were untracked at the time and are in the commit that added this folder, in a later revision; `untrackedFiles` could not record them then. The SYN001 audio came from an earlier version of Benchmarks/synthetic/synthesize.py and the AMI call audio from call generator version 1; the checksums identify that audio. The Whisper size and decode-setting runs also used a temporary local patch to WhisperKit loading (an environment variable naming the variant, and others for the decode options), since reverted and not kept, so those runs cannot be rerun; their stored transcripts can be re-scored. This file was assembled by hand from the output of provenance.py and then corrected, so its `inputs` and package listings are shaped differently from what the script writes.",
